---
import { productsAfter103 } from './data.mjs';
---
<figure class="product-table" aria-labelledby="product-table-title">
 <figcaption id="product-table-title"><span>Figure 1</span> Read across a row, down a column</figcaption>
 <div class="table-paper">
  <p class="reading-key"><span>→ One row describes one product</span><span>↓ One column gives the same attribute for each product</span></p>
  <table>
   <caption><code>products</code> · after order 103</caption>
   <thead><tr><th scope="col">product_id</th><th scope="col">name</th><th scope="col" class="stock"><span aria-hidden="true">↓ </span>stock</th></tr></thead>
   <tbody>{productsAfter103.map(([id,name,,stock])=><tr class:list={{outlined:id==='P7'}}><td><span class="row-marker" aria-hidden="true">{id==='P7'?'→':''}</span>{id}</td><td>{name}</td><td class="stock">{stock}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="row-reading">The outlined row: <strong>P7</strong> is a <strong>Blue mug</strong>, with <strong>0</strong> left in stock.</p>
 </div>
 <p class="figure-note">Selected columns from the invented shop after Mina’s purchase. The stock column gives one count for each product: 10 packets of tea, no mugs and 4 teapots. Row position carries no meaning.</p>
</figure>
<style>
 .product-table{margin:2.5rem 0;font-family:var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.1rem var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:1rem}figcaption>span{font:.7rem var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase;margin-right:.7rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.table-paper{border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);padding:1rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt)}.reading-key{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.5rem;font:.78rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);margin:0 0 1rem}.reading-key span{max-width:18rem}table{display:table;width:100%;overflow:visible;margin:0;font:.84rem/1.6 var(--font-mono)}caption{text-align:left;font:.8rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);padding-bottom:.6rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}th,td{padding:.65rem .6rem!important}th{text-align:left}.stock{border-left:2px dashed var(--color-text-secondary);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--blue) 12%,var(--color-surface))}.outlined{outline:2px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:-2px}.outlined td{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--teal) 12%,var(--color-surface))}.outlined td.stock{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--blue) 12%,var(--color-surface))}.row-marker{display:inline-block;width:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text)}.row-reading{font:.8rem/1.6 var(--font-sans);margin:1rem 0 0}.figure-note{font:.77rem/1.65 var(--font-sans);color:var(--color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:450px){.table-paper{padding:.7rem}table{font-size:.71rem}th,td{padding:.6rem .35rem!important}.row-marker{width:.9em}.reading-key{font-size:.75rem}.row-reading{font-size:.76rem}}
</style>
